{
	"name": "@compass/agent",
	"version": "0.1.0",
	"description": "First-party Compass agent built on the OMP SDK (@oh-my-pi/pi-agent-core), emitting compass.v1 natively over the AgentGateway socket. Runs inside the per-agent container; the Runner execs `compass-agent` and relays its frames.",
